WEBVTT

00:00:58.891 --> 00:01:00.120
So I came out.

00:01:00.692 --> 00:01:03.005
Turns out, if you spend most of your life

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:05.291
working in the conservative
religious world,

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:09.413
coming out as transgender
is not all that great for your career.

00:01:09.437 --> 00:01:11.038
(Laughter)

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:13.230
Who knew?

00:01:13.254 --> 00:01:14.765
(Laughter)

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:21.126
Within seven days, I lost
every single one of my jobs.

00:01:21.572 --> 00:01:24.645
My family was supportive but struggling.

00:01:24.669 --> 00:01:27.194
Most of my friends
and coworkers had rejected me;

00:01:27.218 --> 00:01:29.037
the rest were confused.

00:01:29.473 --> 00:01:33.012
One friend said,
"You really messed with me."